  "findings": "Basal long-petioled divided evergreen leaves and separate branching nodding pale flowers. Generic mid-stem flat foliage and tan flowers rejected. Dedicated helleborus staged. Current seeds 1, 4 and 7 and every panel in the 36-seed contact sheet were visually inspected. Long petioles support divided foliage beneath separate branching pale flower stalks. The 25\u201347 cm forms avoid the former mid-stem foliage hats. Individual nodding cups remain coarse at this pitch. Accepted as a coarse stylized spring source at 25 mm; user endorsement remains separate.",
